OL,3,ABurnham says public body will invest in
OL,4,Aelectricity grid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has announced a new
OL,7,Fgovernment body to invest in Britain's
OL,8,Felectricity grid in his first party
OL,9,Fconference speech as Labour leader.
OL,11,FThe prime minister told party activists
OL,12,Fin Liverpool that the new publicly
OL,13,Fowned company, branded Great British
OL,14,FGrid, will speed up connections to the
OL,15,Fgrid by driving up competition for
OL,16,Fconnection projects.
OL,18,FBurnham is putting the proposals at the
OL,19,Fheart of a new goal to bring UK energy
OL,20,Fcosts in line with other nations in
OL,21,FEurope within 10 years.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
