OL,3,ABurnham says public body will invest in
OL,4,Aelectricity grid
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe promised on Tuesday to have an
OL,7,F"honest conversation" with the public
OL,8,Fand take on the "difficult issues" that
OL,9,Fhave been ignored for too long.
